{"name":"Azure Dragon","hex":"#053976","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Azure Dragon","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A Chinese dragon."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Azure_Dragon"}],"entries":[{"title":"Azure Dragon","blocks":[{"text":"The Azure Dragon is one of the Dragon Gods who represent the mounts or chthonic forces of the Five Regions' Highest Deities. It is also one of the Four Symbols of the Chinese constellations, which are the astral representations of the Wufang Shangdi. The Azure Dragon represents the east and the spring season. It is also sometimes referred to as the Blue-Green Dragon, Green Dragon, or the Blue Dragon."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Azure_Dragon.jpg/330px-Azure_Dragon.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azure_Dragon"},{"title":"Azure (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Azure is the color between cyan and blue on the color wheel. It is often described as the color of the sky on a clear day."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Azulejos_Parque_Eduardo_VII-2.jpg/330px-Azulejos_Parque_Eduardo_VII-2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azure_(color)"},{"title":"Dragon","blocks":[{"text":"A dragon is a mythical creature found in the folklore of cultures throughout the world. It is roughly serpentine in form, and often possesses features drawn from different animals, such as wings and claws. In nearly all cultures, it is conceived of as a powerful and awe-inspiring creature."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/St_Catherine%2C_St_George_and_the_Dragon_%28M%C3%A4staren_fr%C3%A5n_Kappenberg%29_-_Nationalmuseum_-_18337_%28brightened%29%2C_draken.png/330px-St_Catherine%2C_St_George_and_the_Dragon_%28M%C3%A4staren_fr%C3%A5n_Kappenberg%29_-_Nationalmuseum_-_18337_%28brightened%29%2C_draken.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dragon"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Azure_Dragon_at_Marina_Bay_Sands.jpg/500px-Azure_Dragon_at_Marina_Bay_Sands.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Azure_Dragon_at_Marina_Bay_Sands.jpg/1280px-Azure_Dragon_at_Marina_Bay_Sands.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Azure_Dragon_at_Marina_Bay_Sands.jpg/500px-Azure_Dragon_at_Marina_Bay_Sands.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Azure Dragon display at Marina Bay Sands, Singapore, during Lunar New Year 2024.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAzure_Dragon_at_Marina_Bay_Sands.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Yangshan_Quarry_connector_road_-_marker_-_Azure_Dragon_-_P1060799.JPG/500px-Yangshan_Quarry_connector_road_-_marker_-_Azure_Dragon_-_P1060799.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Yangshan_Quarry_connector_road_-_marker_-_Azure_Dragon_-_P1060799.JPG/1280px-Yangshan_Quarry_connector_road_-_marker_-_Azure_Dragon_-_P1060799.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Yangshan_Quarry_connector_road_-_marker_-_Azure_Dragon_-_P1060799.JPG/500px-Yangshan_Quarry_connector_road_-_marker_-_Azure_Dragon_-_P1060799.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Azure Dragon on a road marker at Yangshan Quarry","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYangshan_Quarry_connector_road_-_marker_-_Azure_Dragon_-_P10